  "Family follows the ink: connect-the-dots cost curves, the two coupled-equation charts and the six-series seeding chart are line; the cellular-automaton page is a screenshot, so photo-or-raster-image [geometry.family].",
  "The pie chart of the 2009 electricity mix is recorded as other with an explicit other_note, because the vocabulary has no pie class and calling it bar would misdescribe the ink [geometry.family].",
