  "No table in this paper shades its rows, and none merges cells; the condition lines above the three cost tables are read as conditions, not as header rows [table.zebra].",
  "Two measured regions belong to one exhibit on p15: the chart frame and the legend box beside it, so the legend is excluded as a fragment of the chart rather than counted as a second figure [place.page_order]."
